{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03363","headline":"游法华寺 · 宋之问","name":"游法华寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高岫拟耆闍，真乘引妙车。\n空中结楼殿，意表出云霞。\n後果缠三足，前因感六牙。\n宴林薰宝树，水溜滴金沙。\n寒谷梅犹浅，温庭橘未华。\n台香红药乱，塔影绿篁遮。\n果渐轮王族，缘超梵帝家。\n晨行踏忍草，夜诵得灵花。\n江郡将何匹，天都亦未加。\n朝来沿泛所，应是逐仙槎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}